# Redesign continuation checklist

When editing frontend or desktop UI:

1. Audit shell + shared components first (`App.tsx`, layout, `components/shared/*`, `components/ui/*`, `styles/ea-theme.css`).
2. Prefer token/CSS changes that cascade over one-off page rewrites.
3. Keep web light/calm; keep desktop darker/denser via `data-platform`.
4. Do not reintroduce glow-heavy “AI control panel” chrome.
5. Preserve approvals, command modal, live refresh, and navigation behavior.
6. After UI changes: `cd frontend && npm run build`.
7. If desktop framing changes, update `docs/FRONTEND_DESKTOP_UI.md` when shared vs desktop-specific boundaries shift.

Active redesign branch context: `cursor/light-calm-frontend-shell-44d4` / PR #289.
